From: ReadyNAS NG <readynasng@build>
Subject: [PATCH 09/23] sparc: Padre: PCI host bridge

The PCI bridge of the IT3107 carries the VIA VT6212 USB controller of
the ReadyNAS Duo v1. padre_pci.c (after 2.6.17 pcic.c/setup.c):
configuration cycles, bus reset, PCI_FEATURE/PCI_SWAP setup (the bridge
swaps CPU accesses, padre_pciswap), memory window, INTA interrupt; DMA
addresses are bus addresses. The Sun PCIC driver is excluded.
---
 arch/sparc/Kconfig             |   2 +-
 arch/sparc/include/asm/padre.h |   1 +
 arch/sparc/kernel/Makefile     |   3 +
 arch/sparc/kernel/padre_pci.c  | 324 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 329 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/sparc/kernel/padre_pci.c

